    { "key": "howto.on_table", "value": "On the table" },
    { "key": "howto.goal.title", "value": "Goal" },
    { "key": "howto.goal.body", "value": "The game uses the 40-card Spanish deck. You score points every round; the first to reach the game's target (21 in the classic game) wins." },
    { "key": "howto.goal.caption", "value": "The four suits: coins, cups, swords and clubs" },
    { "key": "howto.values.title", "value": "Card values" },
    { "key": "howto.values.body", "value": "Cards 1 to 7 are worth their number. Face cards are worth more: the jack is 8, the knight 9 and the king 10. The key is to add up to 15." },
    { "key": "howto.values.caption", "value": "Jack = 8 · Knight = 9 · King = 10" },
    { "key": "howto.turn.title", "value": "Your turn" },
    { "key": "howto.turn.body", "value": "Each player is dealt 3 cards and 4 go face up on the table. On your turn you play one card: if its value plus one or more table cards adds up to 15, you take them all into your pile. Otherwise, the card stays on the table." },
    { "key": "howto.turn.caption", "value": "5 + 7 + 3 = 15: you take all three cards" },
    { "key": "howto.mandatory.title", "value": "Taking is mandatory" },
    { "key": "howto.mandatory.body", "value": "If the card you play can make 15, you must take cards. If there are several combinations, you choose one. When everyone runs out of cards, 3 more are dealt until the deck runs out." },
    { "key": "howto.mandatory.caption", "value": "10 + 5 = 15 or 10 + 2 + 3 = 15: choose one" },
    { "key": "howto.escoba.title", "value": "Escoba" },
    { "key": "howto.escoba.body", "value": "If your take leaves the table empty, that's an escoba: 1 point. If the 4 table cards add up to 15 (or 30) when dealt, the dealer takes them and scores an escoba (or two)." },
    { "key": "howto.escoba.caption", "value": "6 + 4 + 5 = 15 and the table is empty: escoba!" },
    { "key": "howto.round_end.title", "value": "End of the round" },
    { "key": "howto.round_end.body", "value": "When the deck runs out and everyone has played their last card, any cards left on the table go to the last player who took cards (it doesn't count as an escoba). Then the round is scored and the next player deals." },
    { "key": "howto.points.title", "value": "Points each round" },
    { "key": "howto.points.body", "value": "Each escoba: 1 point · Most cards: 1 point · Most coins: 1 point\nSeven of coins: 1 point · Setenta: 1 point\nIf there's a tie in cards, coins or setenta, nobody gets that point." },
    { "key": "howto.points.caption", "value": "The seven of coins is worth 1 point" },
    { "key": "howto.setenta.title", "value": "The setenta" },
    { "key": "howto.setenta.body", "value": "Take your best card of each suit in this order: 7, 6, 1, 5, 4, 3, 2 and face cards. Whoever has more sevens wins; if tied, the next best card decides. If you're missing a suit, you can't win it." },
    { "key": "howto.setenta.caption", "value": "A good setenta: two sevens, a six and an ace" },
    { "key": "howto.players.title", "value": "Players and teams" },
    { "key": "howto.players.body", "value": "Play with 2 to 4 players, against the AI or on this device by passing it around. With 4 you can play in teams: partners sit facing each other and share their pile and points." },
    { "key": "howto.controls.title", "value": "Controls" },
    { "key": "howto.controls.body", "value": "Tap or click a card in your hand: the table cards you can take light up. Mark the ones you want and press Play. Shortcut: double-tap the card, or drag it to the table, when there's no choice to make. The Menu button pauses the game." },
    { "key": "credits.body", "value": "<b>Development</b>\nresuacode\n\n<b>Cards (temporary) and sound effects</b>\nKenney (kenney.nl): Playing Cards Pack and Casino Audio, CC0 license\n\n<b>Music</b>\n\"Lobby Time\", \"Local Forecast - Slower\", \"Bossa Antigua\", \"Cool Vibes\"\nKevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)\nLicensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License\nhttp://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\n\n\"Chill lofi inspired\": omfgdude, loop edit by qubodup (OpenGameArt), CC0\n\n<b>Made with</b>\nUnity" },

